      "lesson_progress": 0.125,
      "text": "Today we are investigating decimal place value. What happens when we split one whole into smaller equal parts? The same base ten pattern continues beyond the decimal point. After ones come tenths, hundredths and thousandths. Each place is one tenth of the value of the place immediately to its left.",
      "chapter": "Base ten continues past ones",
