      "start": 20.984791666666666,
      "end": 38.05779166666667,
      "lesson_progress": 0.25,
      "text": "Read four point seven two six. The four is four ones. The seven is seven tenths, written zero point seven. The two is two hundredths, written zero point zero two. The six is six thousandths, written zero point zero zero six.",
